  "description": "My name is Hyosin Lee, and I just want to get one thing straight: I am not a thief! I ran away from home to escape my stifling household but ended up lost in the mountains where I found a pile of clothes. How was I supposed to know that they belonged to the very handsome half-fairy, San Baek? He has (reluctantly) let me stay with him because I was badly injured. He doesn’t talk much, but he’s kind and I like being with him… However, I know it won’t be long until my family finds me and when that happens… I’ll never be able to see San again! \n\n(Source: Tapas) \n\n*Note: Includes 12 side story chapters*",
